**Problem**: `api.service.ts` (853L frontend API client) must be split into a 1-line shim + `api.service/` module directory — preserving the public module path so all 4 importers stay untouched, with a strict 2-symbol public surface and zero barrel leaks.

**Final layout** (each internal module keeps its own types; only the barrel decides what's public):

```
src/
  api.service.ts                  # 1-line shim (public path unchanged)
  api.service/
    index.ts                      # barrel: exports ONLY api + ApiError
    errors.ts                     # ApiError class + internal helpers
    http.ts                       # fetch transport (internal)
